# 统一行尾策略：文本文件入库与检出均为 LF（跨平台 diff 干净，避免 CRLF 噪音淹没真实改动）
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理 / PowerShell 脚本保持 CRLF（cmd / PowerShell 解析要求）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 常见二进制资源：禁止任何行尾转换，防止误改字节流
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.docx binary
*.dotx binary
*.icns binary
*.pak binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
